Duties and Responsibilities
The Deputy Vice Chancellor shall be reporting to the Vice Chancellor. He/she will be accountable to and under the general authority of the Vice Chancellor. His/her duties and responsibilities will include
having the overall responsibility of direction, organization of learning, research and Students Affairs programmes in the University;
