REQUIREMENTS FOR APPOINTMENT
Served in the grade of Assistant Director either in Human Resources and Administration or Finance and Planning for a minimum period of three (3) years or served in a comparable and relevant position in the public or private sector for a minimum period of twelve (12) years, eight (8) years of which must have been at management level;
